[01:44.763]Goodbye, I tried
{"再见　我已尽力"}
[01:48.540]I've never tried So hard
{"从未如此努力过"}
[01:53.816]My faith has kept me here
{"信念让我坚持至今"}
[01:56.993]Fighting to my last breath
{"战斗至最后一息"}
[02:01.388]So please let me go
{"所以请放我离去"}
[02:08.309]To a place that no one knows
{"去往无人知晓之地"}
[02:11.818]Please break my soul
{"请击碎我的灵魂"}
[02:17.227]Cause I'm
{"因为"}
[02:19.490]Ready to move on
{"我已准备好前行"}
[02:22.561]Everything is done and gone
{"万物皆已消逝"}
[02:26.895]Nothing left of my worries
{"忧虑荡然无存"}
[02:31.131]Only remnants of my lost dreams
{"仅剩破碎梦想的残影"}
[02:35.496]This blank canvas I call home
{"这片空白的画布我称之为家"}
[02:39.867]Is my birthplace and my tomb
{"既是诞生之地也是坟墓"}
[02:44.349]For the first time in my life
{"人生中第一次"}
[02:48.570]I'll be saying goodbye for the last time
{"我将说出最后的告别"}
[04:04.577]Closed Eyes, I tried
{"紧闭双眼　我尝试过"}
[04:08.087]To understand what's lost
{"去理解失去的意义"}
[04:13.220]Truth hurts and I knew it would
{"真相伤人　我早已知晓"}
[04:17.051]End like this someday
{"终会如此落幕"}
[04:21.011]So please let me sleep
{"所以请让我长眠"}
[04:27.627]For all eternity
{"直至永恒"}
[04:31.317]Just forget me
{"只需遗忘我"}
[04:36.687]Cause I
{"因为"}
[04:39.078]Don't know where to go
{"不知该去往何方"}
[04:42.384]What to keep, what to let go
{"该保留什么　又该放下什么"}
[04:46.576]Things were never meant to be
{"一切本就不该发生"}
[04:50.733]All my dreams fade away with me
{"所有梦想都随我一同消逝"}
[04:55.077]The endless pain I once shouldered
{"我曾背负的无尽痛楚"}
[04:59.606]Lifted from my broken soul
{"从破碎灵魂中得到解脱"}
[05:03.872]But one aching pain remains
{"唯有一道刻骨伤痛残留"}
[05:08.130]As I remember the times we've had together
{"当我忆起我们共度的时光"}
[06:06.069]Can't hear
{"听不见"}
[06:08.526]Can't see
{"看不见"}
[06:10.419]One last
{"最后"}
[06:12.801]Hug now
{"拥抱吧"}
[06:14.844]Can't feel
{"感受不到"}
[06:16.936]Can't love
{"无法去爱"}
[06:19.443]Peace has
{"安宁已"}
[06:21.573]Come now
{"降临"}
[06:23.582]This end...
{"这结局..."}
